{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103015","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103015/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103015/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103015/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103015","id":2861743529,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6qkr2p","number":103015,"title":"Texture blurriness in `SubViewportContainer`","user":{"login":"AdamLearns","id":60950402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTUwNDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60950402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamLearns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-02-18T22:12:23Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T15:00:29Z","closed_at":"2025-02-23T16:59:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in `v4.4.beta1.mono.official [d33da79d3]`\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS Sonoma 14.6.1 (23G93)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI see a lot of similar issues that were filed already, but none that seem to still be open that cover the scenario I'm in:\n\n- `display/window/stretch/mode` is `disabled` (#77149, #86975)\n- This is on v4.4.beta1 where some of those issues should already have been fixed (#54030, #71403)\n- There are no pop-ups involved (#54030)\n\nThe issue is that a `TextureRect` inside of a `SubViewportContainer` looks blurry while a `TextureRect` outside of that container looks crisp. Same thing with a `Sprite2D`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSet up this scene hierarchy:\n\n- `Node`\n  - `SubViewportContainer`\n    - `SubViewport`\n      - `TextureRect` with size `64, 64`\n  - `CanvasLayer`\n    - `TextureRect` with size `64, 64`\n\n...and that's it. Even in the editor, it's apparent that the texture in the `SubViewportContainer` is blurry:\n\n<img width=\"961\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e64294f5-5990-49c3-b3ba-f16062baaf20\" />\n\nI originally thought this was caused by setting `ContentScaleFactor`, which is why the minimal repro has buttons to change that. I left the buttons in the repro since it's much more obvious at higher scale factors.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[ContentScaleFactorRepro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18854811/ContentScaleFactorRepro.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103015/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103015/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}